      "aliases": [],
      "title": "Public dashboards discloses all direct mode datasources",
      "summary": "When using public dashboards and direct data-sources, all direct data-sources' passwords are exposed despite not being used in dashboards.\n\nNo passwords of proxied data-sources are exposed. We encourage all direct data-sources to be converted to proxied data-sources as far as possible to improve your deployments' security.",
